  <item>
    <title>EP01 · 开学+开春，和00后校园恋综制作人谈谈恋爱这件小事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6412e39fe52db99e47292c81</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6412e39fe52db99e47292c81</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Mar 2023 09:38:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqPcOPpIXiufsTp6byyplcA3PGN6.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期简介</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>去年，B站上走红了好几档大学生自己做的校园恋综，虽然制作粗糙也没有流量明星坐镇观察室，但挡不住溢出镜头的胶原蛋白和青春气息。一群早就被抛入社会的“老年人”观众在网上围观大学生谈恋爱，被生生拽回了大学时光，发酵了成千上万的弹幕讨论。当代大学生课余生活已经丰富到需要自制综艺节目来填补精神需求了？花钱花时间花精力做“爱情雷锋”到底图啥？恋综女制片人爱上男嘉宾，到底何去何从？</span></p><span></span><p><span>春天来了，又是一年开学季，空气中浮动的都是暧昧的气息，在这个万物萌发蠢蠢欲动的时节，《尼龙热线 NYLON Hotlines》首期节目聊聊校园恋综！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FooCjOs_bOsUgoJRX-vf2AUqBYn1.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqXES-grwEpxuoe5UFJb2RNdQetT.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>内容索引</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="601">10:01</a> 大数据帮你匹配心动的ta</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">12:24</a> 节目被骂就说明真的有人在看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 当节目嘉宾变身校园明星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">21:25</a> 恋综主创都是“爱情雷锋”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a> 节目录制前一天被嘉宾放鸽子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2154">35:54</a> 激起无数校友的青春回忆杀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2541">42:21</a> 接受相亲说明我们长大了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2902">48:22</a> 我们希望从恋爱课上学点啥</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>制作团队</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>内容统筹：wuwu、Kush</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容策划：Tz</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容执行：Ruby、文锦</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期编辑：杨钧杰</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计：程锦远</span></p><span></span><p><span>————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于《尼龙热线 NYLON Hotlines》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Hold on，年轻人！欢迎接通「尼龙热线 NYLON Hotlines」☎️。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为一家关注青年文化的媒体，《NYLON尼龙》全新推出的这档播客节目，与年轻人不间断地对话与讨论，持续关注高校社团新动向，聚焦年轻人息息相关热点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家订阅并收听鲜活生动、思维跳脱疆域的年轻人电台。</span></p>]]></description>
